<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>AMAYRA SMART MEMBERSHIP</title>

<style>

*{
margin:0;
padding:0;
box-sizing:border-box;
font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;
}

body{
background:#000;
display:flex;
justify-content:center;
align-items:center;
height:100vh;
padding:20px;
}

.container{

background:#111;
width:100%;
max-width:420px;

border-radius:20px;
padding:25px;

text-align:center;

border:2px solid red;

box-shadow:0 0 25px rgba(255,0,0,.5);

}

.logo{

width:170px;

border-radius:20px;

margin-bottom:20px;

}

h1{

color:#ffffff;

font-size:30px;

margin-bottom:10px;

}

h2{

color:#ff0000;

margin-bottom:20px;

}

p{

color:#cccccc;

font-size:16px;

line-height:26px;

margin-bottom:25px;

}

.btn{

display:block;

background:red;

color:white;

text-decoration:none;

padding:16px;

font-size:20px;

border-radius:12px;

font-weight:bold;

}

.footer{

margin-top:30px;

font-size:13px;

color:#888;

}

</style>

</head>

<body>

<div class="container">

<img src="image.jpg" class="logo">

<h1>WELCOME TO</h1>

<h2>AMAYRA CAR WASH</h2>

<p>

Thank You For Choosing

AMAYRA CAR WASH.

Become Our Premium Member

And Enjoy Exclusive Benefits.

</p>

